00:04:56.074 --> 00:04:57.724
- It's a competitive advantage,

00:04:57.724 --> 00:04:59.596
it's a competitive vantage, you know?

00:04:59.596 --> 00:05:03.310
The thing for me is
like I just don't care.

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:06.563
I do the right thing at the
right moment every time--

00:05:06.563 --> 00:05:09.579
- And if they're not about
it, just on with them?

00:05:09.579 --> 00:05:10.597
- Yeah 'cause I don't think

00:05:10.597 --> 00:05:12.968
