Wisconsin, or Indiana right,

00:05:49.257 --> 00:05:50.525
I woulda been like oh,

00:05:50.525 --> 00:05:51.393
(laughing)

00:05:51.393 --> 00:05:54.401
I didn't even know that meant anything.

00:05:54.401 --> 00:05:57.455
I was in a such an
immigrant, insular cocoon

00:05:57.455 --> 00:05:59.675
