it's good to go to Penn.

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:13.204
You know, like your roommate
might be fuckin', you know?

00:06:13.204 --> 00:06:14.661
- Yeah.

00:06:14.661 --> 00:06:15.494
That's very true.

00:06:15.494 --> 00:06:16.399
- Like I didn't know.

00:06:16.399 --> 00:06:18.363
That's given me an unbelievable advantage.

